# The repository currently has template/node_modules committed (~560 MB). Without
# this exclusion it is copied into the build context twice, and worse, the
# `COPY template/ ./` in the runtime stage overwrites the node_modules that the
# image's own controlled `npm install` just produced — so the image would ship
# whatever happens to be checked in, including prebuilt binaries for other
# platforms (e.g. @remotion/compositor-win32-x64-msvc/*.dll). Dependencies must
# come from npm install against package.json, not from the working tree.
template/node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Local scratch and build output — never belongs in an image.
temp/
sandbox
sandbox-executor
*.log
.env
.git/
